  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Substitute <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Hence <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi></math>, as&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math><mo>=</mo><mi>&#960;</mi></math></p>",
